; Klatt's duration rules 2 to 4. Four cards a segment in (kind, liq, fs, pf); out four factors in hundredths, one a
; rule in turn, 100 where a rule doesn't apply (multiplying by 100 leaves PRCNT as it is), so that every segment has
; the same number of cards. Rule 2: phrase-final (pf) 140. Rule 3: a vowel not phrase-final 60; a phrase-final
; consonant after the vowel that is L R M N or NX (liq) 140. Rule 4: a vowel not in its word's last syllable (fs 0)
; 85. A pause (kind 8) has none of them.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-22: a segment; rule 2
  04                    INP   liq
  05                    INP   fs
  06                    INP   pf
  07                    CLA   c100
  08                    STO   f
  09                    CLA   kind
  10                    SUB   c8
  11                    TAC   sound
  12                    OUT   f        a pause: four 100s
  13                    OUT   f
  14                    OUT   f
  15                    OUT   f
  16                    JMP   rec
  17            sound   CLA   pf
  18                    SUB   00
  19                    TAC   r2
  20                    CLA   c140
  21                    STO   f
  22            r2      OUT   f
  23                    CLA   kind     23-35: a consonant: rule 3's liquid, and no rule 4
  24                    SUB   n2
  25                    TAC   syl
  26                    OUT   c100
  27                    CLA   liq
  28                    ADD   pf
  29                    SUB   n2
  30                    TAC   cl
  31                    OUT   c140
  32                    JMP   c4
  33            cl      OUT   c100
  34            c4      OUT   c100
  35                    JMP   rec
  36            syl     CLA   pf       36-49: a vowel: rule 3, rule 4
  37                    SUB   00
  38                    TAC   v60
  39                    OUT   c100
  40                    JMP   v4
  41            v60     OUT   c60
  42            v4      OUT   c100
  43                    CLA   fs
  44                    SUB   00
  45                    TAC   v85
  46                    OUT   c100
  47                    JMP   rec
  48            v85     OUT   c85
  49                    JMP   rec
  60            kind    DATA  0
  61            liq     DATA  0
  62            fs      DATA  0
  63            pf      DATA  0
  64            f       DATA  0
  65            c8      DATA  8
  66            n2      DATA  2
  67            c100    DATA  100
  68            c140    DATA  140
  69            c85     DATA  85
  70            c60     DATA  60
